briefing =
    Commander Lin Haoran. The island no chart names is real, and the Obsidian Directorate watches it with sensor masts. Tonight a three-man team lands on its western beach: Tanya, a network specialist and one Red Spear.
    
    Each mast sees a circle around it. Some sweep and sleep; watch the circle dim before you cross. Reach the core node in the east, deploy the specialist to copy the routing logs, then bring him to the boat at the north cove. Every mast that sees you, or goes dark, sends the garrison to look.
    
    If the island sees you too often, or Tanya or the specialist falls, the operation fails.
